of: record
form: <<END
name: text 1..64
fills: text 1..400
segments: natural 1..24
move: text 1..400
tide: object 1..128
END
head: {name}
voice: a gathering, counted in segments, that comes on whether anyone posts or not
about: a clock that fills while a condition holds; moves when full
text: want stranded "a field that names no place: the town repairs it, or its maker sets it": "stranded" in new.marks.name and not ("repaired" in new.marks.name) asks delvetalk {request.object} repair
body: front
